Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.27,0:00:13.24,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back of\Nmy super strong partner, Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has Heavy always had\Nsuch superhuman strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he had blessing\Nof might like Lamas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I guess he's been\Nholding back this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like a lie by omission and he\Nclaims not to believe in telling lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:00:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:01:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, a clergyman going\Naround murdering people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a human being first\Nand a clergyman second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll quit my Band ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you, sir, just spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gods say that death is serene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It comes to each of us impartially, but\Nthere is one point on which I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death itself may very well\Nbe impartial. Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay whatever you ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who meet out death must not be\Nimpartial where scumbags are concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DO YOU WANT WOMEN OR RINCES?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PLEASE!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.90,0:01:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DON'T KILL ME. PLEASE. DON'T KILL ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ENOUGH.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DON'T THINK YOU CAN MAKE A FOOL OF ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU WON'T GET AWAY WITH THIS!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU IDIOTS ARE FINISHED, YOU HEAR ME!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.05,0:01:58.93,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,450)\fscx70\pos(476.8,52.4)}Blizzard in the Desert
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:01:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Stratum Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:01:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ogre that dwells on the\Ntop floor of the desert pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the Stratum Lord. You're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye and meet your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awake, dual ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it meal time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love meal time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the eating is good today, my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one is my prey\Nand I shan't yield him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you you can't steal from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could say the same thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I staked my claim on him first, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised you I'd help and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please know how I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take down this monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo and the rest of\Nus will make quick work of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat meat everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can we make a meal of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the thighs and entrails for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for this stratum's final showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better not underestimate\Nus! What? No! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh! Barrier time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points decreased by 2,222.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only lost a thousand points when that\Nmonstrous eight-legged crocodile rammed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't smash us! Dumb human!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't that take down the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those attacks keep hitting me,\NI'll be scrap metal in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This foe is beyond any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, this is the first\Ntime we've fought a Stratum Lord head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:03:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until now, we've exploited\Ntheir weak points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And being under the Nether\NLord's command might
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have made the other\Nones weaker than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our feet are getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if that would make anyone stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is sounding real loud\Nand scary back there, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think! Water? Ice? Flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much food!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat made everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's eating the monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their stomachs must outweigh their anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll give them my\Npersonal fave, authentic barbecue sauce.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.32,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H1F1B2F&\3c&H1F505F&\shad0\bord4}Umai Barbecue Sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.95,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H1F1B2F&\3c&H1F505F&\shad0\bord4}Umai Barbecue Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the real deal stuff for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should buy us a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have told you all more about\Nthe Stratum Lord before we went in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do\Nagainst an opponent like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd respond with\Na carefree, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of being useful,\NI was just a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I allowed my anger\Nto get the better of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for exposing\Neveryone to grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:06:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologizing will not\Nimprove the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, let us think on\Nwhat to do about that ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least our choices are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can either run away or defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too strong an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should consider running.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we left Tashtay in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chances are he's already dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or more likely that the dual ogre\Nwill eat him in a matter of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even that magic skull ring could\Nbring the foul monster to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be fair, the skull ring\Ncan only handle simple commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to a Stratum Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,signaling it to attack is\Nthe most one could hope for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So speaking of Tashtay's skull\Nring, if the dual ogre ate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no chance the ogre would\Nthen gain control of it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lamas, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not outside the realm of possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it were to come to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Stratum Lord would suddenly be\Nin control of a slew of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if it uses those monsters\Nto attack the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears we've narrowed\Ndown our options.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should take it down once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll defer to you, Master Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it if a decision\Nlike that were not up to me, Michele.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, guys, did you forget\Nthat I'm a vending machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you hoping for from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, er, uh, Bill, it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need more information?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has two heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right is male, the left, female.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem to disagree on things\Nsometimes, but they basically get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its body is much tougher than\Nsteel, and you've seen its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It probably tops even Lamas\Nin terms of its raw strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My attacks are formidable, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But aren't Lamas' and\NMishuel's even more so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they could penetrate\Nsomething as strong as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to determine the\Ndual ogre's blessings, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blessing of might, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that power was off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the problematic one is hardening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes it way tougher all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would partly explain\Nwhy my attack didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So blessing of might and hardening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds simple, but it is hard to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We maybe could have worked something\Nout if the captain were here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the blessing of eye breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use in wishing\Nfor what we don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to work\Nwith what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wise words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know it's a big\Neater and heavy drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that sounds a lot\Nlike Japanese ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are old tales about attacking\Nthem after you get them drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drunk? Alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can offer it limitless alcohol! Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.77,0:08:27.36,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H5B4934&\3c&HFCFEFE&\shad0\bord4}Ogre Killer
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.52,0:08:30.36,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H5B4934&\3c&HFCFEFE&\shad0\bord4\pos(520,23)}Ogre Killer
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.98,0:08:30.36,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H09181B&\3c&HA3EDFB&\shad0\bord4}Bakufu Dance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's quite a lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we get that thing to drink all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll drink it if a\Npretty girl pours it for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we know about an ogre's\Nconcept of beauty, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we could find a pretty ogre lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know any of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could make it\Nhallucinate a hot ogre lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had a fair number of\Nencounters with ogres in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's not out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to speak\Ntheir language, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know of it, and I can teach you\Na smattering at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know if it'll work or not,\Nbut we're all out of other ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.61,0:09:16.07,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(479,130)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm. Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he is, folks, a rock ogre monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's actually heavy with\Nan illusion cast on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I am on his back, transformed\Ninto a vending machine made for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,32-liter plastic bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the water inside's been replaced\Nwith various alcoholic drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes nothing, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you decide it's too dangerous,\Ndon't hesitate to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a rock ogre doing in our lair?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ogre speak we learned from Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a greeting of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that? Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get rid of the strings and caps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's my favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do like to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wouldn't hurt to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me this one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never had a drink that\Ntastes like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just feeling thirsty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a thoughtful rock ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those last two\Nbottles are the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully they'll do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The booze is making me feel\Nnice and sleepy. Let's rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let it be a waste. Let's drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think a drunk ogre is\Ngoing to wake up that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we doing with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's filled with booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the needle went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears they have to be conscious\Nto use the blessing of hardening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This syringe was supposed to be for\Ntaking out the elder tree fiend,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it sure came in handy anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do feel kind of bad for attacking\Nthis thing while it's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pains me as well, but in my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no room for pity when\Nyou're fighting a duel to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you agree, Master Boxxo? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I'll take this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can handle that side, Mishuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? What is it, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said beat them with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're the one who defeats the enemy,\Nthen you'll gain the winning points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I understand. Let's see then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I swing Boxxo and I hit them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's attack at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stratum lord for you even though i split\Nit three ways with llamas and Mishel
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i still got over a million points is\Nit all right if i absorb the dual ogre
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold on just one more moment there's a\Nvaluable part in here but i'm cool with
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doing it after I retrieve that.\NGo ahead, Kikoyu. That's appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better do a quick recon\Nto see what became of Tashtay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I would be most grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it just get cold in here? Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it coming from above?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is rather strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much colder in\Nhere than it is outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the night chill creeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever do you think this\Ncould mean, Master Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, it's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it literally is, and like how\Nwith us being in the middle of a desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been frozen in ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please gather\Naround Boxxo, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Boxxo, raise your barrier! Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here in the scorching sand stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know of any monster on this\Nstratum that can control air temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are a snow fairy. You are surely\Nmistaken if you regard us as enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're friendly we simply\Ncame here to see that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what was that for we\Nsnow fairies are not a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,race that has ever been\Nknown to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so wantedly as that\Nwhat's a snow child doing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with humans in the first\Nplace these people are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friends humans are scum\Nyou know that too don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you it's true that i live\Nmy whole life on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from humans director bear\Ntold me before about the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mysterious power snow\Nchildren like Kikoyu have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legend has it that if you\Nbehead a snow child on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the day it becomes an\Nadult they will transform
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into a magical ice statue\Nthat will never melt
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as for the severed head\Nit will continue to utter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are curses that have the power to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,contaminate entire\Nregions in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not all humans are bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some you can trust!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not just humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel this trustworthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are many people like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humans have tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You misunderstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are not your enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my enemies. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, you also work\Nfor the Netherlord? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, seems not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I look closely at that steel box,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks just like that magic item\NBoxxo of which the Netherlord spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm famous and didn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I to take these statements to\Nmean you work for the Netherlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am his medicine\Ngeneral known as Sulream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord's general?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord saved me just\Nbefore some humans who had
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captured me were about to\Nmurder me quite ruthlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been by his side ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so well timed it bugs\Nme what if the Nether Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,set that up so he could get\Nhis hands on a snow fairy's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powers sounds like something\Nhe'd try my lord's words and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:16:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his commands mean everything\Nto me you're in our way goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're in big trouble the second we step\Nthrough this barrier we'll freeze well Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have plenty of points, so I\Ncould try to tough this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does every snow fairy have\Nincredible powers like she does?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our power levels vary, but it is\Nunusual to see someone on such a level.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is rather powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long do you think\Nthis blizzard will last?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, with this kind of power, the\Nstorm could go on for two to three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxo, how long can your barrier hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if I'm using up ten points\Na second based on my current points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try again to persuade her. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine even if I\Nhave to step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am moved and grateful for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:17:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I want to stop\Nher, even if I get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is me, or who I'd be\Nif I had never met Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had I also met the\NNetherlord before Field,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'd have turned out\Nlike her, I'm sorry to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel sorry for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be lying if I said I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is more to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll trust in that. Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, do you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, it'll be midnight\Nin less than a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I will be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are strangely calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did snow just start blowing\Nin from the other way, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm pretty sure it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pushing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another snow fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think she showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think she came to save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know her intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do know her boots are\Nexactly the same as Kikuyu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though it's increased far beyond what\NI have always felt from her till now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do sense the same energy as Kikuyu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose this could mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means she's Kikuyu, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She grew up in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that actually Kikuyu?\NHuh? There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that the moment Snow\NFairies reached their 18th birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they suddenly grow up\Ninto full-fledged adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means, today's\NKikuyu's 18th birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why she's been keeping such a close\Neye on her calendar the past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's the day with the\Nred circle around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's just past midnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her magical powers are far\Nbeyond what they were before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know the change\Nwould be so dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even rival that general's powers,\Nwhich is really saying something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an equal match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Kikuyu is pushing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ask one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.28,0:19:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you leave this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is something that\NI still need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my own mission as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, you win. I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still a little cold,\Nbut it's safe to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, you really are, Kikuyu, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could have seen her\Nin the moment of transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's like a transformation\Nsequence in a magical girl anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to have recorded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxo, are you having weird thoughts again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go, trying\Nto play innocent. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess with all that settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can say things are wrapped\Nup on this stratum, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel for heavy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay to leave? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tosh take out even more than he\Nhad coming to him, by my math.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, watching him suffer was\Nnever going to fully erase my grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will be with me till the\Nend of my days, or so I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I am satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I didn't know Heavy could\Nmake such an inspiring face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I to take your statement to mean\Nthat you were concerned about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only concern is whether you're\Ntrying to sniff my boots or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the same time, boots\Ndon't matter anymore, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were still feeling down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have been willing to give\Nyou my boots to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but were you\Nbeing sincere just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't care about boots anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that I was driven by\Nrevenge to search for footwear,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's also true that I\Nhave awoken to its appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, please make good on your\Noffer and take off those boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in you personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've had my eye on\Nyour boots for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're indifferent about your clothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I suspect those boots\Nyou've been wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will give off the most\Nexquisite fragrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, you nasty pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take back what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a play too, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis, that's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can produce any amount of snow you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about when a\Nsnowball fight broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we take part in the snow\Nbattle as well, Master Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The snowball fight on the scorching\Nsand stratum sounds sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.06,0:23:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back to the back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of my life, I'll come back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.58,0:23:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end of my
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.06,0:23:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handle them on my
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own you could even
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.90,0:23:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,win a reward you
